  "body": "Perfectly positioned to optimise the sunshine, with stunning views across the Hauraki Gulf to Cape Colville and Tiritiri Matangi, this immaculately presented four-bedroom home offers versatile family living with stylish bathrooms, abundant indoor - outdoor flow to a range of living spaces, landscaped and productive gardens, plus a lined sleepout that’s destined to become one family member’s favourite retreat, home office or studio with a view. \r\nThe entertainer’s kitchen, with plenty of bench space and storage cupboards, is central to the expansive open plan living, surrounded by generous sundecks, all complete with that glorious coastal outlook! \r\nYour northwest facing, covered patio with water feature offers exquisite, sheltered yet sunny, alfresco dining, entertaining and outdoor living all year-round. Why not round out a delightful evening with a spa under the stars? – It’s the perfect place to relax and unwind over bubbles.\r\nThe layout favours families that appreciate the ability to grow, gather together or take time out in their own spaces, with living all on one level and bedrooms both close to and separated from the master. The master suite itself is incredibly special, comprising a spacious, light and airy floorplan, ample wardrobe through to your sunny, designer-tiled bathroom, and your own private deck, overlooking the harbour sunrises, twilight blues and valley lights, to recharge your senses, any time of day. \r\nThe ever-necessary double garage with internal access, workshop and separate toilet provides security, convenience and comfort for the home handyperson or for unloading kiddies and groceries in any weather.\r\nLocated in one of Torbay’s well-loved, established, freehold neighbourhoods, you will enjoy the feeling of peace and serenity that cul-de-sac dwellers have come to know and value. With the whole section positioned towards the sunshine, and sheltered from the South, you can make the most of the established, landscaped gardens for growing fresh produce, throughout the seasons.\r\nWith some of Auckland’s finest beaches just down the road, your family is sure to love the holiday atmosphere and wide range of seaside and shorefront activities on offer here. \r\nThis beautifully maintained home can manage a crowd, or intimate gathering alike, where families can enjoy light-filled living and entertaining friends and honoured guests with confidence. \r\nA recent building inspection is available for interested parties who have viewed the property.\r\nCall Shane or Jen now for your chance for an early viewing, or we’d love to meet you here at one of our family-friendly open homes.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n•Generous freehold, 652sqm section with spacious, versatile, floorplan.\r\n•Four spacious bedrooms including Master suite with private sundeck and harbour views.\r\n•Northeast facing for sunlight and coastal outlook.\r\n•Northwest side covered patio and water feature for exquisite alfresco dining all year round.\r\n•Spa pool for relaxing with bubbles under those spectacular long summer sunsets and starlit nights.\r\n•Additional lined sleepout, with sea views, for guests, teenagers, studio or office. This might be the cosy corner that family members compete for most.\r\n•Cul-de-sac living in established neighbourhood.\r\n•Zoned for well-esteemed schools such as Glamorgan Primary, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n•Expansive living area with family area, dining and lounge surrounding the central, entertainers’ kitchen.\r\n•Excellent indoor – outdoor flow to sundecks, covered patio, spa pool and garden\r\n•Fruit trees and vegie garden for planting with your choice of fresh produce\r\n•Double internal access garage with workshop and extra toilet\r\n•Additional off-street parking for cars and trailer.\r\n•Reticulated gas for cooking, heating (appliance outlet) and water heating.\r\n•Heat pump for year-round ambience.\r\n•Essential coastal family living in well-loved neighbourhood.\r\n•Beautifully maintained home with recent building report available for interested viewers.",
